  "slug": "maximum-score-of-spliced-array",
  "title": "拼接数组的最大分数",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-034",
  "studyTags": [
    "数组",
    "动态规划"
  ],
  "summary": "可选择一个连续区间交换两个等长数组对应元素，分数为交换后某一个数组的元素和，求最大可能分数。",
  "insight": "若以 nums1 为目标，交换区间带来的增益是 nums2[i]-nums1[i] 的最大子数组和；反向同理。分别做 Kadane 后加原数组和取最大。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "可以选择不交换，所以增益下限为零",
    "要同时考虑最终取 nums1 或 nums2 的和",
    "交换区间必须连续"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "two-direction-kadane-gains",
      "title": "双向 Kadane 增益",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "把区间交换转化为差分数组最大子段和。",
      "steps": [
        "计算 sum1、sum2",
        "扫描维护 gainTo1=max(0,gainTo1+nums2[i]-nums1[i]) 及其最大值",
        "同理维护 gainTo2",
        "返回 max(sum1+best1,sum2+best2)"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/two-direction-kadane-gains/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/two-direction-kadane-gains/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/two-direction-kadane-gains/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
